WEBVTT

00:00:01.270 --> 00:00:08.150
The new morning we've finally found

00:00:01.270 --> 00:00:08.150
Yatto mitsuketa atarashii asa wa

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:12.190
is being hampered by the past.

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:12.190
Tsukihi ga jama wo suru

00:00:12.390 --> 00:00:17.660
What we chased after wasn't the future,

00:00:12.390 --> 00:00:17.660
Mukau saki wa tsugi ja nakute

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:21.490
but the past so full of remorse.

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:21.490
Sugi bakari oikaketa

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:27.960
The ruthless memories won't stop playing;

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:27.960
Nariyamanai yousha nai omoide tachi wa

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:32.050
they won't be forgiving us for a long time.

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:32.050
Yurushite kuresou nimonai

00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:37.890
It's about now that a teardrop

00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:37.890
Sorosoro kana tesaguri tsukareta hoho wo

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:42.560
beings to roll down my fatigued cheeks.

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:42.560
Kattou ga koboreochiru

00:00:42.890 --> 00:00:47.810
Will this rain ever stop?

00:00:42.890 --> 00:00:47.810
Ame wa itsuka yamunodeshouka

00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:53.030
I've been freezing for a long time.

00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:53.030
Zuibun nagai aida tsumetai

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:58.320
Why does the rain continue to fix on me?

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:58.320
Ame wa doushite boku wo erabuno

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:03.080
I wonder if it could embrace me.

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:03.080
Tsutsumarete iikana

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:07.870
Today, the rain falls again;

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:07.870
Ame wa yamu koto wo shirazuni

00:01:07.870 --> 00:01:13.090
endlessly it falls knowing no end.

00:01:07.870 --> 00:01:13.090
Kyou mo furitsuzukukeredo

00:01:13.090 --> 00:01:18.130
We nestle close to each other to share the warmth

00:01:13.090 --> 00:01:18.130
Sotto sashidashita kasa no naka de

00:01:18.680 --> 00:01:29.850
under this umbrella, you gently held out to me.

00:01:18.680 --> 00:01:29.850
Nukumori ni yorisoinagara

00:01:38.860 --> 00:01:40.070
What's the matter?

00:01:40.070 --> 00:01:42.160
The soldiers outside want to start negotiating.

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:45.540
We're only sending one man! He's on his way now!

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:47.500
Be sure not to shoot!

00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:51.420
Hands above your head!

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:53.670
Do anything suspicious and we won't hesitate!

00:01:58.430 --> 00:01:59.630
He's fine.

00:02:00.930 --> 00:02:02.100
Let him through.

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:04.720
He's someone we can trust.

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:27.500
Second Lieutenant!!

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:39.010
I wonder if there's any way for me to see my husband right now...

00:02:39.010 --> 00:02:40.090
You mustn't!

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:43.550
There's no telling what could happen to you.

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:50.230
There's still a chance that the army is currently under control of the anti-Bradley faction.

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:52.850
Please be patient for a little longer.

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:54.560
I see...

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:57.150
You're right.

00:03:01.260 --> 00:03:04.260
Eye of Heaven, 
Gateway of Earth

00:03:01.260 --> 00:03:04.260
Eye of Heaven, 
Gateway of Earth

00:03:07.410 --> 00:03:10.710
So, you say you refuse to acknowledge Truth?

00:03:10.710 --> 00:03:12.000
That's exactly right!

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:16.250
You also seem to think you've won
after gathering all the human sacrifices,

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:19.380
but you won't have your way with us so easily!

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:21.760
Nonsense.

00:03:23.130 --> 00:03:25.220
Can you stand? We're going to get out of here.

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:27.470
Don't bother trying.

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:34.020
All of you are already inside my belly.

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:42.070
What on earth is this?

00:03:42.070 --> 00:03:45.870
Is the 'Father' guy inside of that thing?

00:03:47.870 --> 00:03:51.910
He should be with our father by now.

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:56.080
Though I certainly can't guarantee that he is with no physical defects.

00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:03.220
May!

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:04.130
Midget!

00:04:04.130 --> 00:04:07.680
Hey you, with all the eyes! You're immortal, aren't you?

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:11.770
So you're not going to deny it.

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:16.560
Sir Alphonse, let me handle him.

00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:20.070
H-Hey, you won't be able to take him on alone!

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:22.820
Nope, I can use Eastern Alchemy.

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:27.370
I get that you'll still be able to use alchemy even after he seals it off, but...

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:32.410
I'm going to need you two to take on the little homunculus.

00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:40.130
Easier said than done...

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:49.470
He forced the colonel to open the gate...?

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:54.640
Then why didn't he do that to begin with?

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:55.850
Fullmetal.

00:04:57.270 --> 00:04:59.770
When he dragged me into the transmutation,

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:04.030
he said, "I didn't really want to have to use this method, but we're fairly short on time."

00:05:04.440 --> 00:05:07.820
Meaning it carries a great risk for them.

00:05:07.820 --> 00:05:08.870
Probably.

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:12.620
Guess it's worth a shot.

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:20.210
All right! We can use alchemy!

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:21.880
He's running?!

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:24.260
He used to always avoid them using his shadows!

00:05:25.050 --> 00:05:26.510
We may have a chance!

00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:27.760
Right!

00:05:31.550 --> 00:05:36.520
Messing up my house again? You evil kids.

00:05:40.020 --> 00:05:42.650
Your immortality is mine!

00:05:51.870 --> 00:05:55.450
You don't belong here.

00:05:55.450 --> 00:05:56.540
Out!

00:06:07.090 --> 00:06:08.300
Watch out, little girl!

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:09.590
He can transmute without-

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:20.600
May!

00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:28.700
Just what on blazes is going on?

00:06:28.860 --> 00:06:32.700
We still can't get in touch with headquarters.

00:06:32.700 --> 00:06:34.080
Reporting in!

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:36.870
Several Ishbalans have appeared within the city!

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:38.500
They've engaged in combat with the guards in-

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:40.250
You-

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:42.630
My apologies.

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:46.300
We don't really have the time to explain.

00:06:46.300 --> 00:06:47.420
Forgive us.

00:06:55.510 --> 00:06:58.270
No! No!!

00:06:58.270 --> 00:07:00.270
Help me! Someone, help me!

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:02.100
My apologies, lady.

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:04.230
We mean no harm, so please tell us...

00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:07.690
This is the house located here on this map, right?

00:07:17.700 --> 00:07:19.790
It's starting to get really dark.

00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:22.080
I wonder if everyone's doing their job...

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:23.750
You sure this is the right place?

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:25.960
Yeah, positive.

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:30.050
Great.

00:07:30.760 --> 00:07:32.090
Now...

00:07:32.930 --> 00:07:35.510
The rest is up to you, Scar.

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:47.690
It's nice to be face to face with death every once in a while.

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:55.530
Right now, the only thing in my mind is the fact that I'll fight to the death with you.

00:07:58.410 --> 00:08:02.160
Social status, career, origin,

00:08:03.160 --> 00:08:05.670
race, gender, name...

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:10.460
...none of that matters.

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:16.140
Not being bound by anyone and fighting just for the sake of it.

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:20.640
How astounding.

00:08:22.810 --> 00:08:25.400
I've finally reached this stage.

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:42.200
What's wrong?!

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:44.080
Is this all you've got?!

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:45.000
That's not enough!

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:47.540
Hardly enough!

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:53.970
Destroy me, nameless one!

00:09:43.220 --> 00:09:47.190
You look surprised.

00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:49.480
I don't blame you.

00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:51.610
If you were to ask me some time ago,

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:59.700
even I wouldn't have imagined that I'd be using something like this.

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:09.420
I had always been thinking about what I was capable of doing.

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:12.460
And this was the conclusion I'd reached.

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:20.260
It's the transmutation circle of reconstruction that I obtained from my brother's research documents!

00:10:22.390 --> 00:10:27.020
You humans just continue to struggle.

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:39.950
May!

00:10:41.950 --> 00:10:43.070
Shit!

00:10:43.070 --> 00:10:45.790
Al, you go help May.

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:46.950
What about Pride?!

00:10:47.410 --> 00:10:49.080
Leave him to me.

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:50.790
I can take him!

00:10:53.630 --> 00:10:54.630
Roger that!

00:11:07.810 --> 00:11:08.890
Little girl!

00:11:10.890 --> 00:11:13.690
You keep your mouth shut, Hohenheim.

00:11:20.900 --> 00:11:22.700
Sir Alphonse...

00:11:35.080 --> 00:11:36.750
What's the matter now?

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:38.960
Those are some weak blows!

00:11:39.260 --> 00:11:41.470
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:11:41.920 --> 00:11:44.390
Until you perform your duty...

00:11:44.390 --> 00:11:46.680
You need to keep me alive, eh?!

00:11:46.680 --> 00:11:50.020
Then I'll just kick both of your asses before that happens!

00:11:50.180 --> 00:11:51.430
"Kick our asses"?

00:11:51.430 --> 00:11:53.140
Do try.

00:11:53.140 --> 00:11:57.900
Since you have a small stature, you've always been fighting against people larger than you.

00:11:58.070 --> 00:12:02.570
Thus, you have little experience fighting against those who are smaller than yourself!

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:10.700
I apologize beforehand if I hit you, Dad!

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:24.050
You little...!

00:12:24.380 --> 00:12:27.640
I do admit that I've always been fighting against people who were bigger than me!

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:28.680
And that's exactly why...

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:35.650
...I know how little guys tend to attack!

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:42.150
Master!

00:12:42.820 --> 00:12:45.820
Transmuting with no movement? That's kind of annoying.

00:12:49.620 --> 00:12:51.660
It's almost time.

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:20.730
Playtime ends here.

00:13:21.110 --> 00:13:24.150
Time for you all to get to work.

00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:37.000
It's pitch dark...

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:37.920
Hurry...

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:43.250
Hurry and take us to the middle of the transmutation circle...

00:13:43.590 --> 00:13:44.590
Hurry!

00:13:44.960 --> 00:13:46.720
We can't stay here!

00:13:46.470 --> 00:13:47.340
Quit throwing a fit!

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:50.890
Hurry up and take me to the center!

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:51.930
Hurry!

00:13:51.930 --> 00:13:53.100
We're going to get devoured!

00:13:54.220 --> 00:13:55.640
Hurry!!

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:16.160
The time has come!

00:14:27.130 --> 00:14:33.100
Have you all ever thought of this planet as one life form?

00:14:35.390 --> 00:14:40.390
Well, it would be more accurate to call it a system rather than a life form.

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:46.400
A system that records a tremendous amount of information taken from the universe,

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:50.910
which is incomparable to the tiny amount that each of you humans possess.

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:52.910
If one were to open that gate,

00:14:53.320 --> 00:14:56.950
how much power do you suppose they would gain?

00:14:57.410 --> 00:15:00.580
Ever thought of it?

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:07.420
I'm going to open that gate here and now
using these human sacrifices!

00:15:14.760 --> 00:15:16.680
So that's the center!

00:15:17.470 --> 00:15:18.390
Greed!

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:22.900
The center of the world belongs to me!

00:15:23.100 --> 00:15:26.070
The world is mine!

00:15:26.980 --> 00:15:28.070
He did it.

00:15:38.740 --> 00:15:43.250
I knew you'd come, Greed, my son.

00:15:44.790 --> 00:15:48.800
You're the avarice that was born from me.

00:15:50.130 --> 00:15:54.930
It's only natural that you'd want everything I'd want.

00:16:00.810 --> 00:16:01.680
Ed!

00:16:33.550 --> 00:16:36.090
The true center of the world...

00:16:36.800 --> 00:16:38.050
...is right here!

00:16:46.850 --> 00:16:48.730
Damn you...!

00:17:13.010 --> 00:17:14.510
W-What's going on?!

00:17:23.390 --> 00:17:24.770
This is...!

00:18:03.180 --> 00:18:06.770
That's right, allow the gates to fight each other!

00:18:06.770 --> 00:18:08.690
Repel one another!

00:18:11.440 --> 00:18:13.520
What an immense amount of energy!

00:18:13.520 --> 00:18:17.440
I'm almost unable to hold it down by myself.

00:18:21.530 --> 00:18:26.500
And with this power, I shall open the gate of the planet!

00:18:59.780 --> 00:19:00.990
What on earth?!

00:20:01.970 --> 00:20:03.760
Win...ry...

00:20:06.010 --> 00:20:08.720
What's... going on...?

00:20:09.720 --> 00:20:12.270
Miss Pinako, what's...

00:20:13.060 --> 00:20:16.730
Hohenheim... I'm going to punch you...

00:20:17.690 --> 00:20:19.360
...when you come back...

00:20:22.820 --> 00:20:23.820
Ed...

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:27.120
E... d...

00:21:22.050 --> 00:21:25.840
God!!

00:21:26.880 --> 00:21:30.350
Respond to my soul!

00:21:30.970 --> 00:21:32.220
Come!

00:21:53.870 --> 00:21:56.870
That's right, come!

00:21:56.870 --> 00:22:00.790
I shall no longer be chained down by You!

00:22:04.420 --> 00:22:09.800
I shall drag You down to earth and make You a part of me!

00:22:39.250 --> 00:22:42.800
Ever since that day passed,

00:22:39.250 --> 00:22:42.800
Ano hi kara zutto

00:22:42.800 --> 00:22:47.050
I promised myself that I'd never cry.

00:22:42.800 --> 00:22:47.050
Nakanaito kimetekitakedo

00:22:47.590 --> 00:22:52.600
But even while I hoarded up the pain,

00:22:47.590 --> 00:22:52.600
Itami wo kasanetemo

00:22:52.600 --> 00:22:57.710
there was something I couldn't forgive myself for.

00:22:52.600 --> 00:22:57.710
Nanika wo yurusezu ni ita

00:22:59.190 --> 00:23:01.150
I'll never be able

00:22:59.190 --> 00:23:01.150
Mou modorenai

00:23:01.150 --> 00:23:03.650
to return to those days.

00:23:01.150 --> 00:23:03.650
Ikutsumo no hibi

00:23:03.650 --> 00:23:08.740
I'm still powerless.

00:23:03.650 --> 00:23:08.740
Boku wa mada nanimo dekizuni

00:23:08.740 --> 00:23:13.990
I watch as the shards of memories disappear, one by one;

00:23:08.740 --> 00:23:13.990
Kimi no ita kioku no kakera

00:23:13.990 --> 00:23:19.860
memories of when you were still with me.

00:23:13.990 --> 00:23:19.860
Mata hitotsu kieteyuku

00:23:20.540 --> 00:23:22.880
I long to become

00:23:20.540 --> 00:23:22.880
Kyou yori motto

00:23:22.880 --> 00:23:25.630
stronger than I am now,

00:23:22.880 --> 00:23:25.630
Tsuyoku naritai

00:23:25.630 --> 00:23:30.770
so that my voice will eventually reach you.

00:23:25.630 --> 00:23:30.770
Kono koe ga itsuka todokuyouni

00:23:30.770 --> 00:23:33.140
If the wind happens to stop

00:23:30.770 --> 00:23:33.140
Arukitsuzukete

00:23:33.140 --> 00:23:35.850
in the midst of my long journey,

00:23:33.140 --> 00:23:35.850
Kaze ga yandara

00:23:35.850 --> 00:23:40.560
I'll look up at the sky in search of you.

00:23:35.850 --> 00:23:40.560
Kimi wo sagashite sora miageruyo

00:23:41.310 --> 00:23:47.900
Beyond the daybreak, a ray of light breaks free.

00:23:41.310 --> 00:23:47.900
Yoake no saki ni hikari ga sasuyo

00:23:49.070 --> 00:23:53.450
A rainbow spans across the sky.

00:23:49.070 --> 00:23:53.450
Niji ga kakaruyo

00:24:00.120 --> 00:24:05.790
Bow before him, humans, if he is who you call a god.

00:24:06.460 --> 00:24:09.760
But if you do not acknowledge him so, fight!

00:24:09.760 --> 00:24:12.380
Stake thy pride.

00:24:13.260 --> 00:24:17.640
Next time, Fullmetal Alchemist:

00:24:17.640 --> 00:24:22.160
Episode 61, He Who Would Swallow God.

00:24:17.660 --> 00:24:22.160
He Who Would 
Swallow God.

00:24:22.810 --> 00:24:26.860
"God" is an invention of those with nobody else to turn to.
